@startuml
title GoF Pattern : Adapter

note as GoFLabel
  **<<Adapter>>**
end note

interface "PaymentInterface" as Target {
  - id: int
  + amount: float
  - processPayment(): void
}
class "CheckoutAdapter" as Adapter {
  - paymentInterface: PaymentInterface
  + checkoutSystem: CheckoutSystem
  - processPayment(): void
}
interface "CheckoutSystem" as Adaptee {
  - id: int
  + amount: float
  - processCheckout(): void
}

Adapter --> Target : wraps
Adapter --> Adaptee : uses
GoFLabel .. Target
@enduml